  "body": "Commanding a prestigious north-facing position on one of Mission Bay's most desirable streets, this extraordinary brand-new architectural residence sets a new benchmark for sophisticated coastal living. Combining striking contemporary design, exceptional craftsmanship and advanced residential technology, this remarkable home captures spectacular sea views across Rangitoto Island and the Hauraki Gulf, offering an exceptional lifestyle.\r\n\r\nOccupying a substantial 940sqm (approx.) freehold site, the residence offers approximately 367sqm of meticulously crafted living space across three levels, complemented by a large sun-drenched deck and a separate 13.5sqm poolside cabana. Thoughtfully positioned to maximise all-day sunshine, the home embraces abundant natural light, spectacular coastal vistas and an extraordinary sense of space, privacy and tranquillity.\r\n\r\nDesigned for both refined family living and sophisticated entertaining, the residence features five generously proportioned bedrooms, elegant living spaces and an exceptional collection of lifestyle amenities. A dedicated media room, games room, private gymnasium, wine cellar and peaceful tea room provide versatility for relaxation, recreation and entertaining, while an oversized double internal-access garage adds everyday practicality. Every space has been carefully considered to balance family connection with individual privacy and comfort.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, a beautifully appointed designer kitchen with walk-in pantry and premium appliances combines contemporary elegance with outstanding functionality. Vienna Woods oak flooring, bespoke cabinetry, carefully selected natural materials, designer lighting and premium finishes create an atmosphere of understated sophistication. Expansive glazing, double glazing and comprehensive climate control further enhance year-round comfort, reflecting an uncompromising commitment to quality, performance and enduring appeal.\r\n\r\nAs a brand-new residence, the property also offers the confidence of modern construction and contemporary technology, together with the added reassurance of a 10-Year Halo Residential Guarantee, providing valuable peace of mind for years to come.\r\n\r\nJust minutes from Mission Bay and Kohimarama beaches, residents can enjoy waterfront walks, vibrant cafés, acclaimed restaurants and the relaxed coastal atmosphere that defines Auckland's prestigious Eastern Bays. Eastridge Shopping Centre and Orakei Bay Village offer further shopping and dining conveniences, while easy access to the CBD, transport connections and excellent schooling options completes this outstanding lifestyle offering.\r\n\r\n64 Codrington Crescent is a statement of lifestyle, achievement and uncompromising quality.\r\n\r\nOpportunities to secure a newly completed home of this calibre in such a tightly held Mission Bay location are exceptionally rare. We invite you to experience this remarkable coastal sanctuary for yourself.\r\n\r\nPrivate viewings available by appointment.\r\n\r\nFor agents: Conjunctional sales are welcome and encouraged.",
